5. Launch the second goal (below). It publishes the site, then copies the LOB-Game art into this project, writes the Unity code and the scene builder, and stops when it needs you. One to two days with your checks in between.
6. When it says "check in Unity": open LOB-OVER in Unity 6000.3.8f1, menu **LOB Over â†’ Build â†’ Site Scene**, open `Assets/LOBOver/Scenes/Site.unity`, press **Play**. Desktop preview: the chain plays by itself (collapse Day 4, argument Day 5, rain Day 9, finish Day 24); WASD and mouse to look. Report what you saw in one line; the run continues.
7. When it prints `READY_FOR_HEADSET`: headset plugged in, developer mode on; File â†’ Build Profiles â†’ Android â†’ **Build and Run**. Put on the headset, pick MR Diorama. That is the stakeholder demo. Pick VR Site for the inspector seat.
